{"id": 8258534047942, "title": "Momcozy Soothing Gel Pads", "body_html": "<p><span class=\"a-list-item\"><strong>Instant Cooling Relief: </strong>Momcozy hydrogel pads deliver long-lasting cooling comfort. Infused with a polymeric hydrogel enriched with lanolin, they provide up to 3 hours of soothing comfort. For an extra cooling boost, simply store them in the fridge.</span></p>\n<p><span class=\"a-list-item\"><strong>Protect Sore Nipples:</strong> Designed to help reduce the likelihood of irritation caused by friction from bras or clothing, these nursing pads create a protective barrier that helps maintain skin comfort. Plus, they’re gentle enough to remove without leaving any residue.</span></p>\n<p><span class=\"a-list-item\"><strong>Individually Wrapped for Hygiene: </strong>Each pad is individually sealed in a clean aluminum foil pouch. With 6 disposable pads per pack, you get convenient, hygienic protection whether you’re pumping or nursing.</span></p>\n<p><span class=\"a-list-item\"><strong>Safe for Nursing Moms: </strong>Free from petroleum, preservatives, and fragrance, these BPA-free pads feature a soft, double-layer non-woven fabric that’s gentle on sensitive skin.</span></p>\n<p><span class=\"a-list-item\"><strong>Must-Have for New Moms: </strong>These nipple pads make a thoughtful gift, offering much-needed relief and comfort during breastfeeding. Be sure to add them to your baby registry or hospital bag.</span></p>", "vendor": "momcozy", "product_type": "Gel Pads", "created_at": "2024-07-04T05:57:33-04:00", "handle": "momcozy-soothing-gel-pads", "updated_at": "2026-10-13T03:54:56-04:00", "published_at": "2024-07-04T05:57:33-04:00", "template_suffix": "bp-bf009", "published_scope": "global", "tags": "baby carrier for newborn, breast pads, 乳房护理, 吸奶器, 吸奶器小品, 小品主链", "variants": [{"id": 43928749211846, "product_id": 8258534047942, "title": "6 PCS", "price": "8.99", "sku": "BF009-NA00NB-A", "position": 1, "compare_at_price": "8.99", "fulfillment_service": "